.TH tubase64 n 0.23.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
tubase64 \- Base64 helpers using Tcl core binary encode base64 and binary decode base64.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
.nf
set b64 [::tclutils::tubase64::encode $bytes]
set data [::tclutils::tubase64::decode $b64]
.fi
.PP
Commands:
.IP
\fBencode data ?\-maxlen n?\fR
.IP
\fBdecode text\fR
.IP
\fBencodeFile path ?\-maxlen n?\fR
.IP
\fBdecodeFile path\fR

